# Why: When any BizRethink-namespaced site-setting row is upserted (admin
#      UI save), the corresponding in-memory cache in
#      `@bizrethink/customizations/server-only/*-config.ts` must be
#      invalidated so the next request picks up the new value WITHOUT a
#      process restart. Otherwise, admin UI saves appear to succeed but
#      take no effect until the next deploy.
#
#      Currently handles only `site.security-headers` cache invalidation,
#      which is overlay 032's surface. Other BizRethink site-settings
#      (signup-config, webhook-config, captcha-config) are read fresh
