#   slice (the one that appears in the 2026-05-25 merge conflict list);
#   the other 032 surfaces will be patchified in post-merge cleanup
#   (see Task #10). When 032 is fully regenerated, this 029 patch
#   should be folded back in to keep all security-headers-related
